  <item>
    <title>55. 日常好物分享！好用之外，活成自己喜欢的样子！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a48d6ef3fb7233cbf439b4a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a48d6ef3fb7233cbf439b4a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 09:51:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎来到「自然生长」。</span></p><p><span>这一期干货满满，都是我们平时生活里真正喜欢并且在用的东西。认真生活，找到自己想要的且适合自己的东西，这个过程本身就非常美好。收听愉快！也非常欢迎你在评论区和我们分享你的日常好物！❤️</span></p><p><span>🎙️本期主播：</span></p><p><span>Tanya，500强创新营销、人生教练。小红书@Sincerely,Tanya</span></p><p><span>Lisa，TheOneCrew社群主理、体育经纪公司创始人。微博小红书@金怡玉玲Lisa</span></p><p><span>🎧内容时间线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 罗技蓝牙键盘，可以连接多个设备，小巧轻薄！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkV0jcTPnehTArTepxebvZQanvmC.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> Flokk骑马椅，大小适中，解放了久坐不适的身体！ </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg7M4CbFvNZVmcxPFN3o5Z31olYm.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 三菱空气炸锅专用锡纸，用来储存蔬果也很方便！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmTF4ZEfhjeIAKKBjiAn31WPqDnU.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> 花王厨房清洁剂：油烟和漂白喷雾 </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpeZLFO1TGJwdGPQ86CdUZSVcDT2.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkHDsG_uQ9Kl0Uc7ZK-5_QB_vxJf.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a> 砧板切菜垫纸 </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5cNRdK8KlIFFCk7is0vvHCj95T.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 主厨秘密碳钢煎锅，无物理涂层，牛排鸡排爱好者必入！ </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnft_tgRi9z8Vlgj_Lu-Vr-D2Gih.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 徒步杖，折叠伸缩、材质轻便！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkyYic7t3yDWBo-mgToYKkrQCt2v.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 推荐给开车的朋友们：途虎养车！性价比很高，且有品质保障！ </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> 戴森Mini Cool便携户外迷你风扇！我找了意想不到的使用场景！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGfL_CpgOFkXDxHNRrMQ7Gng9Hr.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a> 唯资双头眼线胶笔，自带刷子，便宜好用！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpG8na0gOeI42R3_W7CbV5-3X7Bs.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1947">32:27</a> 最近迷上了买腮红！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoNJAHAmeqh73yfq264A-GPBGon_.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> Hourglass的高光和散粉粉饼、遮瑕液、液体腮红，都挺好用的！如果不是很确定色号或者不想积压太多色号，可以在大促期间买大件产品会送一些小的样品来体验！很划算！ </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2174">36:14</a> 玫珂菲的产品，自带刷头！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpF1na0qIoUghMxwLXcVOd8LmVkk.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2269">37:49</a> Shiro家的产品成分天然，气味非常好闻，且审美很在线！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7z5cBEsuAtzy3HlYUZQVh0Txk9.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> KA王子菁华洗衣凝珠，和Lululemon的店香非常像！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvUhqOrqLfoWPI-2HAzp8I9-Fj44.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2487">41:27</a> Elemis卸妆膏，卸妆的过程好似在做SPA！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNOcjA3gahoLpaixXYlOxGo1e7R.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> 指甲的保养：Shiro的卸甲油；香奈儿的护甲底油；TAL的指缘油 </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqV79nUmQp2C-xLuYZUBOwAN_Wk8.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2787">46:27</a> 经常漂发染发烫发的朋友们，好用的护发产品！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTAnVdclJWHknWZ4Tqm-aC5iZOY.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FktsRSDMwpJEZuhHUw_w9g3iPEK-.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3266">54:26</a> 睡眠喷雾</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqt0lqLht9NuHJHRB6y4-_tRxJr2.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">57:06</a> 很认真去生活，去发现适合自己的东西。这个体验本身就很美好！</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
